flowchart TB
    PWR[Power<br/>Supply]:::power
    ANT[GPS Antenna<br/>Connector]:::rf --> UBX[u-blox<br/>GNSS Module]:::rf
    TDC[Time-to-Digital<br/>Converter]:::tdc
    DAC[Precision DAC]:::clk
    OCXO[OCXO<br/>10 MHz]:::clk
    FPGA[FPGA<br/>Divider + Control Loop]
    AMP[Tuned Amplifier<br/>10 MHz]:::clk
    IF[USB + LEDs]

    UBX -->|1 PPS - GPS| TDC
    FPGA -->|1 PPS - local| TDC
    TDC -->|SPI: time interval| FPGA
    UBX <-->|UART| FPGA
    OCXO -->|10 MHz| FPGA
    OCXO -->|10 MHz ref clock| TDC
    FPGA -->|SPI| DAC
    DAC -->|EFC voltage| OCXO
    OCXO -->|10 MHz| AMP
    FPGA <--> IF

    subgraph CH1[Output 1]
        FLT1[Filter]:::clk --> ISO1[Galvanic<br/>Isolation]:::iso --> O1[10 MHz Out 1<br/>SMA]:::clk
    end
    subgraph CH2[Output 2]
        FLT2[Filter]:::clk --> ISO2[Galvanic<br/>Isolation]:::iso --> O2[10 MHz Out 2<br/>SMA]:::clk
    end
    subgraph CH3[Output 3]
        FLT3[Filter]:::clk --> ISO3[Galvanic<br/>Isolation]:::iso --> O3[10 MHz Out 3<br/>SMA]:::clk
    end
    subgraph CH4[Output 4]
        TTL[TTL Driver]:::ttl --> PROT[Series R<br/>+ ESD Protection]:::ttl --> O4[1 PPS Out<br/>SMA]:::ttl
    end

    AMP --> FLT1
    AMP --> FLT2
    AMP --> FLT3
    FPGA -->|1 PPS| TTL
    AMP ~~~ TTL

    PWR ~~~ ANT
    IF ~~~ DAC

